        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ASEETA gaygoorgweaksa eemoojiga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba ang'ula, eaweedida, ea damandida, jea deadeelsiina miyeenooda Yuda ea Yerusalemuun, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaydabwada geat eemoojiga sean, ak gaydeadu dearareang'sa moangoachiyda Yehoshafati, nea aba hoowa gaydeargweaksa aba badahuuka fugeasu, ea aba badayda hearaniischoodeanyu, was Israeli, ghayi darsa jeeda eemoojiga, ak ghwalajaada ng'eanyiideanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwalaja fugeasu aba guura, ak ghoadaw orjeeda gatmooda hiseada, ak ghwashaayda huda aba difaayi, ak ghwali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asaha, ama agooga goowooschi naaha aba heedeanyu, ea Diro ea Sidoni, sea ng'eanyoojiga sean bea Filisti? Heapi gajawalneani ghana jea asimanean ng'asheanda wassean? Gaydalamwach nea ghaarabwaaschi ak gaydaaghuumneegwa waliideang'wa gayghoan badahuukeagwa agooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba noogeandi lapiyeedeanyu ea dahaabu was dahaaboodeanyu ak ea noogeandi haleanjeedeanyu miyaasiin sibwariiy ak ghoayaachi jeesinga gealgeagwa oobati aseeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gicha diibiga Yuda ea diibiga Yerusalemu ea neashaaydi aba heeda fuga Yunani, ak goosheagiidi moonghajeega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'ula, gaydaheat gwariteawa heeda ghayi eashaaydaawi, nea aniini gaydeadeelu waliideang'wa ghwahidu badahuukeagwa agooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aniini gaydashaayda orjoogeagwa ea haweegeagwa, ak ghaayiinyi geatinga fuga Yuda, ak gayghwashaayda aba heeda fuga Sheba, was eemeeda sheagi muuchi; aba gideaba nih ng'asheanda rugu Ng'utamiida.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ASEETA gayghoadaw fugaaschi ghawooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
